claim.claim-text:
a base (102, 202) having an external perimeter;
a fiber management region (120, 220) within the external perimeter of the base (102, 202);
a first splicing zone (110, 210) on a first side of the fiber management region (120, 220); and
a second splicing zone (130, 230) on a second side of the fiber management region (120, 220), the second side opposite the first side;
wherein each splicing zone is separated from the fiber management region by containment walls (140) extending from the base (102) of the optical fiber splice tray.
